| \`trustline_exists\` | \`false\` | Whether the **USDC** trustline is configured (from \`action.yml\`) |
| \`xlm_balance\` | \`5.0000000\` | Native XLM balance reported by Horizon (from \`action.yml\`) |
| \`native_balance\` | \`5.0000000\` | Native XLM balance (alias of \`xlm_balance\`, 7-decimal string) |
| \`asset_balance\` | \`0\` | USDC trustline balance (7-decimal string, \`0\` if no trustline, \`unknown\` on Horizon error) |
| \`comment_url\` | _set after posting_ | URL of this issue comment (from \`action.yml\`) |

